  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Institute Against Torture (DIGNITY) Development of organizational strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- To prepare an organisation-strategy for DIGNITY (2019-2021) that identifies 2-3 priority areas as well as a priority related to organisational effectiveness. The organisation-strategy will be prepared according to the Guidelines for Management of Danish Multilateral Development Cooperation
- Prepare a set of management arrangements that includes provisions for reporting, accounting and budgetting for the grant
- Assist the MFA in conducting the consultation process with relevant departments of the Ministry as well as with DIGNITY.</narrative>
  </description>
